  <!-- EN: Fallen Legion Drone -->
  <OE_Mech_LegionDrone.label>堕落军团无人机</OE_Mech_LegionDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: A small, deployable combat mechanoid usually manufactured inside an ultra-tech Fallen Legion Guard mech. Fallen Legion Drone are expendable melee fighters designed to swarm-attack enemies. They are mounted with non-rechargeable power source. -->
  <OE_Mech_LegionDrone.description>一种小型可部署的战斗机械体，通常在超科技堕落军团守卫机械体内制造。堕落军团无人机是一次性近战战士，设计用于群攻敌人。它们配备了不可充电的电源。</OE_Mech_LegionDrone.description>
